<title>USA: Cyprus Amax sees Q4 $80 mln pre-tax charge.</title>
<headline>Cyprus Amax sees Q4 $80 mln pre-tax charge.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cyprus Amax Minerals Co said Tuesday it plans to post a pre-tax charge of about $80 million in the fourth quarter related primarily to environmental remediation activities at its Miami, Ariz., copper mine.</p>
<p>The charges also include costs to temporarily close the Tohono mine near Casa Grande, Ariz., it said.</p>
<p>Cyprus Amax is a copper and coal producer and also holds a significant position in gold.</p>
</text>
